{"server":"en","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-01_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-01","title":"To Lungmen","storyCode":"2-1","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"f07cb57ca14f6e1a80ac69f45c4e95e283c3436bdd23b1c2808fcbae242d36c7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:14 P.M. \\ Clear \\ Visibility: 19 km\nLungmen, District 5- Inspection and Quarantine Zone"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"They're here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Broadcast","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Attention, please..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Broadcast","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Due to the Catastrophe's interference, all air traffic in Lungmen has been stopped. All entrances to District 5 will be closed in two hours."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Broadcast","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"We thank you for your cooperation during Oripathy inspections."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Broadcast","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"If you discover any unregistered Infected, please inform a nearby peace officer immediately."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Broadcast","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"The L.G.D. will detain them in accordance with the 'Emergency Handling Act.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Broadcast","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Attention, please..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's just like the rumors said..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's go, Doctor."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We're here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island was scheduled to meet with the L.G.D. at 10 o'clock."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"It's 10:14 now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"You were late 14 minutes; therefore, you've wasted 14 minutes of my time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...I'm sorry, Madam Ch'en, we just found out that Reunion is here..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"It's fine, I already know. But that's not important right now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"...Who might this be?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname} is Rhodes Island's consultant. Dr. Kal'tsit should already have informed you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Well, since everyone is here, I'll now need you to follow me to..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en! It's an emergency! Those Infected... they're not..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't panic!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"First Squad, standby! Snipers, get into position!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Civilian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Wh-what's happening?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Let go of me! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Tch... What's going on? Report the situation."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Let me go! ! Why are you arresting me? !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"We didn't do anything wrong! ! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Some Infected... are refusing to be taken in... We're..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I can see that..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Forget it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Detain them all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Disperse the crowd immediately. Open the gates in 30 minutes after you finish the review process."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Also, push the quarantine inspection line forward 40 meters."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Other than you and Dr. {@nickname}, the rest of Rhodes Island will stay here and assist with border security. The two of you, come with me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"If your group can't handle such a trivial task, I will not be able to assign you any missions."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"PC94172, arrange some work for these people. I don't want to see any more trouble tonight."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood, Madam!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Everyone, I'd like you to..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"(Madam Ch'en is really tough... she's stricter than I imagined...)"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"... (Nod)","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"You two."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Follow me."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We're here."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Wh-what a tall building!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"S-sorry..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"... Rhodes Island is undoubtedly capable."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you for your praise, Madam."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"However..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"After the Chernobog incident, there's been a massive surge of refugees into Lungmen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"The Infected should already know what the consequences of entering Lungmen are."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll remind you once more."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Lungmen is the next Chernobog."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. Kal'tsit...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island's representative has already met with Chief Wei."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Please wait here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll notify you shortly."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew... she's really hard to talk to."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname}, from here on, Dr. Kal'tsit will be handling the negotiations."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Please have confidence in her."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["???","Ch'en"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["???","L.G.D. Agent"]}]}
